"If an account exists for the email address you entered, we've sent you a "
"link for setting a new password."
msgstr ""
"Jos antamallesi sähköpostiosoitteelle on tili, lähetimme sinulle linkin "
"uuden salasanan asettamiseen."

#: accounts/templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:8
